Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:06.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who else wants one of my special home-baked brownies?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:06.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁要吃我的特制巧克力蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:07.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I will have one. - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:07.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要一块  -我要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:12.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That's okay. - I'm not having one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:12.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-算了  -不要了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:15.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. It's just my tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:15.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是  是我牙痛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All right. - I'll have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好  -我要一块
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:20.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what's matter? You need a dentist? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:20.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了  你要看牙医吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认识一个好医生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:25.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks. I have a good one too. I just can't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:25.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了  我也认识一个  只是我不能见他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:28.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, that is the problem with invisible dentists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:28.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是隐形牙医的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:31.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why can't you go to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:31.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不能去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because every time I go to the dentist, somebody dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我每次去看牙医  就会有人死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:40.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so weird. Because every time I go to the dentist...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:40.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真诡异  我每次去看牙医
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:42.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I look down the hygienist's blouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:42.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都会偷看医生的胸口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:45.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, what...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:45.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah! First, it was my Aunt Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  第一次是玛丽阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:51.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then there was John, my mailman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:51.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后是我的邮差约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then my cowboy friend, Albino Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后是我的牛仔朋友  艾拜诺·巴伯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:58.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And all these people actually died?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:58.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些人真的都死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. While I was in the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  当我坐在诊疗椅上时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why I take such good care of my teeth now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我都自己保健牙齿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:06.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it's not about oral hygiene. I floss to save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:06.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是为了口腔卫生  我用牙线是为了救人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:09.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebs, come on, you didn't kill anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  拜托  你没有杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:13.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}These people just happened to die when you went to the dentist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是这些人死的时候  你刚好去看牙医
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:17.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell that to them. Oh, you can't! They're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:17.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去跟他们说啊  哦不行  他们都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.45,0:01:21.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》第三季第八集  超长探棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:10.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks, Gunther.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:10.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甘瑟  谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.43,0:02:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I get a napkin too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.43,0:02:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以给一张纸巾吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like you don't already have everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还不够称心如意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.65,0:02:21.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebe, you're in pain. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.65,0:02:21.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你痛得很厉害  
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:25.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you just go to the dentist. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:25.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去看牙医吧  快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alright, fine. But if you're my next victim...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  但如果你是下一名受害者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}don't come back as a poltergeist who sucks me into the TV set.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别化身成厉鬼跑回来  把我吸进电视里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:32.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:32.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保证不会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:34.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Although, don't feel like you can't visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:34.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但还是欢迎你来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, is Chandler here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:42.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:42.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:48.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys, Joey just saw Janice kissing her ex-husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:48.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊看到珍妮斯跟前夫接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:49.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:49.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:52.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what are you gonna do? How are you gonna tell Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:52.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要怎么办  要怎么告诉钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was thinking about that. I think the best way would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直在想这件事  最好的办法就是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:57.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:57.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:00.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, you can't keep this to yourself. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:00.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  你不能保密
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:02.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you know about this, you have to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:02.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然你知道了  就得告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'll kill him. I mean it'll just kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那他就完了  真的完了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you can wait until I go to the dentist. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我去看牙医吧   
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:07.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe I'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:07.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我会了结他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.55,0:03:15.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugly Naked Guy's using his new hammock. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.55,0:03:15.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丑裸男在睡吊床  
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.41,0:03:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like a Play-Doh fat factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.41,0:03:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好像培乐多玩具猪肉工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.17,0:03:20.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to the dentist. So listen okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.17,0:03:20.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去看牙医了  听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:25.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just be on the lookout for anything that you could fall into...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:25.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小心会让你们掉进去的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or that can fall on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是会掉到你们身上的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:29.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:29.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:31.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or just look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:31.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:34.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I also just want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:34.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还想要...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.18,0:03:38.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just want to tell you all that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.18,0:03:38.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想告诉你们...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. I have a problem. I have to go into work for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麻烦事  我得去博物馆忙上几个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:50.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some kids messed up the Homo sapien display.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:50.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一些小孩大闹智人展厅
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么个闹法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.47,0:03:54.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They painted over the word "sapien, " for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.47,0:03:54.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们将名字涂改得只剩"Homo"(即同性恋)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:04:00.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then they rearranged the figures. Let's just leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:04:00.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后又把人偶重新排列  这个就不说了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:02.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So do you want me to watch Ben for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:02.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要我帮你照顾本吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:04.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. That's what I was gonna ask. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:04.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我正要拜托你呢  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:07.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, hello! What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:07.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下  让我来如何
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:10.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You? You want to watch Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:10.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你  你想照顾本
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:18.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes! That would be great! You know I just asked Monica
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:18.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了  我拜托莫妮卡是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:20.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because I know how empty her life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:20.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道她的生活很空虚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:25.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:25.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:26.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got a science question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:26.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个科学问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.11,0:04:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If the Homo sapiens were, 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.11,0:04:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果智人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:32.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}in fact, "homo" sapiens...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:32.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的是"同志"的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:36.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is that why they're extinct?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:36.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们是因为这个才绝种的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, Homo sapiens are people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  智人就是人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I'm not judging.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有批评的意思
